Test files in this folder
=========================

Both files were made by us for this crate, with the `cfb` crate 0.15.0
(MIT, https://github.com/mdsteele/rust-cfb), so the reader is tested on
files from an independent writer.

v3.cfb   version 3 (512-byte sectors), 55,296 bytes
v4.cfb   version 4 (4096-byte sectors), 69,632 bytes

Each holds the same entries:

    /Small                   100 bytes, state bits 0x12345678
    /Big                    5000 bytes (regular sectors)
    /Empty                     0 bytes
    /Sub                    storage, state bits 0x0BADF00D
    /Sub/Inner              4095 bytes (the largest mini stream)
    /Sub/Exact              4096 bytes (the smallest regular stream)
    /Sub/Deeper             storage
    /Sub/Deeper/Leaf          64 bytes
    /\x05SummaryInformation  200 bytes
    /Ünïcode 名前            300 bytes
    /N00 ... /N39           10 + 37 * i bytes, so the directory spans
                            several sectors

Stream number i (counting from 1 in the order above, N00 being the 9th)
holds `data(i, len)` from tests/common/mod.rs: xorshift32 bytes seeded
with i. Storage times are the time the files were made.
